FORM CORR_MAINT_/S4P0/V_ENH_E01 USING VALUE(CM_ACTION) RC.
  DATA: RETCODE LIKE SY-SUBRC, COUNT TYPE I, TRSP_KEYLEN TYPE SYFLENG.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <TAB_KEY_X> TYPE X.
  CLEAR RC.
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01-ENHANCEMENT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01-ENHANCEMENT .
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01-SUB_ENHANCEMENT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01-SUB_ENHANCEMENT .
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01-FEATURE TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01-FEATURE .
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01-MANDT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01-MANDT .
  CORR_KEYTAB             =  E071K.
  CORR_KEYTAB-OBJNAME     = '/S4P0/T_ENH_E01'.
  IF NOT <vim_corr_keyx> IS ASSIGNED.
    ASSIGN CORR_KEYTAB-TABKEY TO <vim_corr_keyx> CASTING.
  ENDIF.
  ASSIGN /S4P0/T_ENH_E01 TO <TAB_KEY_X> CASTING.
  PERFORM VIM_GET_TRSPKEYLEN
    USING '/S4P0/T_ENH_E01'
    CHANGING TRSP_KEYLEN.
  <VIM_CORR_KEYX>(TRSP_KEYLEN) = <TAB_KEY_X>(TRSP_KEYLEN).
  PERFORM UPDATE_CORR_KEYTAB USING CM_ACTION RETCODE.
  ADD: RETCODE TO RC, 1 TO COUNT.
  IF RC LT COUNT AND CM_ACTION NE PRUEFEN.
    CLEAR RC.
  ENDIF.

MOVE /S4P0/T_ENH_E01-ENHANCEMENT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T-ENHANCEMENT .
MOVE /S4P0/T_ENH_E01-SUB_ENHANCEMENT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T-SUB_ENHANCEMENT .
MOVE /S4P0/T_ENH_E01-FEATURE TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T-FEATURE .
MOVE SY-LANGU TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T-SPRAS .
MOVE /S4P0/V_ENH_E01-MANDT TO
/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T-MANDT .
  CORR_KEYTAB             =  E071K.
  CORR_KEYTAB-OBJNAME     = '/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T'.
  IF NOT <vim_corr_keyx> IS ASSIGNED.
    ASSIGN CORR_KEYTAB-TABKEY TO <vim_corr_keyx> CASTING.
  ENDIF.
  ASSIGN /S4P0/T_ENH_E01T TO <TAB_KEY_X> CASTING.
  PERFORM VIM_GET_TRSPKEYLEN
    USING '/S4P0/T_ENH_E01T'
    CHANGING TRSP_KEYLEN.
  <VIM_CORR_KEYX>(TRSP_KEYLEN) = <TAB_KEY_X>(TRSP_KEYLEN).
  PERFORM UPDATE_CORR_KEYTAB USING CM_ACTION RETCODE.
  ADD: RETCODE TO RC, 1 TO COUNT.
  IF RC LT COUNT AND CM_ACTION NE PRUEFEN.
    CLEAR RC.
  ENDIF.

ENDFORM.
